{
  "schema": "onlyclaws-esp.graph.v1",
  "description": "Machine-checkable dependency graph (target topology). Edge = depends-on / uses. Same O(1) rules as mcp_guard.",
  "K": 2,
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "contracts", "role": "contracts", "path": "rlcd/include/panel_display.h + capability.h + arm_driver.h" },
    { "id": "wifi_nvs", "role": "infra", "path": "rlcd/src/wifi_store.cpp + wifi_ap_prov + api_config" },
    { "id": "cloud_http", "role": "infra", "path": "rlcd/src/main.cpp tlsCloud / tlsLua HTTP helpers (target: cloud_http module)" },
    { "id": "tenancy", "role": "infra", "path": "server/tenancy.py" },
    { "id": "render", "role": "infra", "path": "server/render.py" },
    { "id": "device_runtime", "role": "compose", "path": "rlcd/src/main.cpp" },
    { "id": "script_engine", "role": "compose", "path": "rlcd/src/script_engine.cpp" },
    { "id": "control_plane", "role": "compose", "path": "server/app.py" },
    { "id": "panel", "role": "plugin", "path": "rlcd/include/panel_display.h + st7305_rlcd / epd397_panel" },
    { "id": "audio", "role": "plugin", "path": "rlcd/src/audio_es8311.cpp" },
    { "id": "ble_pad", "role": "plugin", "path": "rlcd/src/ble_ctrl.cpp + http_pad.cpp + pad_ctrl.cpp" },
    { "id": "sensors", "role": "plugin", "path": "rlcd/src/sensors.cpp" },
    { "id": "arm", "role": "plugin", "path": "rlcd/src/arm_roarm.cpp + sts_bus + arm_stub.cpp + arm_driver.h", "status": "implemented" },
    { "id": "demos", "role": "infra", "path": "demos/ (Lua apps — data, not a plugin)" },
    { "id": "vision_path", "role": "infra", "path": "vision/ (host pathway B — not ESP)", "status": "implemented" },
    { "id": "jev_servo_path", "role": "infra", "path": "jev_servo/ (host pathway C)", "status": "implemented" }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "panel", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "audio", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "ble_pad", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "ble_pad", "to": "wifi_nvs", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "sensors", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "arm", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "arm", "to": "wifi_nvs", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "contracts", "kind": "dispatches" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "wifi_nvs", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "cloud_http", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "script_engine", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "panel", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "audio", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "ble_pad", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "sensors", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "device_runtime", "to": "arm", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "script_engine", "to": "contracts", "kind": "registers" },
    { "from": "control_plane", "to": "tenancy", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "control_plane", "to": "render", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "control_plane", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements-wire" }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Compose (device_runtime / control_plane / script_engine) may wire plugins; plugin→plugin edges are forbidden.",
    "AS-IS debt: panel/audio/ble_pad/sensors are compiled into one firmware and registered monolithically in script_engine — target is PlatformIO env plugin sets (see PLUGIN-RUNTIME.md).",
    "arm plugin: RoArm STS stack (`esp32-roarm-m2`) + invoke/Lua passthrough; not linked into panel products.",
    "vision_path is host-side pathway B (frame→objects+empties); no edges to ESP plugins — Agent may orchestrate.",
    "jev_servo_path is host-side pathway C (JEV per-joint intervals → one cloud arm.stream); consumes vision state; no plugin edges.",
    "demos/ are cloud-deployed Lua sources, not firmware plugins.",
    "control_plane filters invoke tools by device capabilities[] reported in /status."
  ]
}
